    "body": "I merged upstream/main (e8a7f59, which brings in #331, the adjacent `posting_wcs_rotation.rs` change). The merge applied cleanly, with no conflicts.\n\nI then re-ran `scripts/gate.sh quick` on the merged branch:\n\n- **app:** every suite is green except `probe_op::every_older_kind_keeps_its_stored_id_and_digest_tag`. That test fails identically on upstream main: #331's v52 rung against the test's pinned 51. It is tracked as #344, and this PR does not touch it.\n- **ui:** only the known GPU-adapter failures (the unit tests' `headless_run_succeeds`, `egui_app`, `shell`).\n- All 5 pinning tests in `rotated_wcs.rs` pass.\n",
